    "title": "Balatarin",
    "description": "Balatarin is a link sharing network that was formed with the idea of \u200b\u200bstrengthening skills such as pluralism, sustainability and practicing democracy. \r\n\r\nWith Balatarin you can post links and content, and vote on other users' post. write your own. After you get enough votes, your post becomes 'hot' and goes to the front page and will be seen by all hundreds of thousands of Balatarin visitors.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Balatarin has hundreds of sub-communities known as Balacheh.\r\n\u25a0 Create and manage your own, or and become a member or moderator of other Balachehs.\r\n\u25a0 Write comments, send links, posts and vote on other members' content.\r\n\u25a0 Share your common interests and discuss them with others in Balachehs.",
